<description>&lt;p&gt;Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass, showing attacks on public figures in Ecuador. An Ecuadorian thief pleaded guilty to participation in the largest U.S. jewelry heist, linking Ecuadorian crime to transnational theft. A major Ecuadorian cocaine and weapons trafficking ring was busted in New York, indicating the reach of Ecuadorian criminal networks beyond the country. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBaR2NJSnEtNGdGS05uaU94T05ULXIyQW4yYXdzYnpZMWdGOTU5b1JnSEhfdWNNRjBlNkxwNVZhLXI3aWktSlVkeHlvQ2p3Skg3UUlLLW9HTkd3c2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNM2s5Y0lQTjFCVldHVk90N0gwOGozMnhRdHJWVHU2YUdmakVhbEg4dnRNXzZXd2FzQkFvekRuNHlXbWZLSUpBM3JZVzhYUTB3c2xCakxqaGZUUjBRdmoxYi1mZWVoajk4aWp1cDJvWDgyWDZVanl6bmF4dkJ3MnlSakFSTEpPTm9VaXYtZ3NNeFFvZFRRalA5Z0lCVkRJRFdiVHVV?oc=5&quot;&gt;MalaysiaGazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOSHEtM0pyVEhKYmEyQjdYaFVLSENpenlYQ1k5WHVnOXJVRXAwMjJNRFQxTVNYanRRNFhJSkhMX2FtUXNpdUVMZ3BDX2xaRWs0QkNxeG84bkZISUMzcDdZbHFQeDdPeDhLMnVLOC16Y0FyVnFFVklVUjBHYmJmaS1zbVEzOXFvbUM4TzkzM1NTcUM0ci0zb2FNX2ZvSFFHNTZo?oc=5&quot;&gt;SSBCrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE9QY2hzRmRMdWZGSmdpZm5fM2EzR2kzT0tTaXZWNTFYOF91YUZWSnhLeG0tRll2VWJldGZNdXJBNXcxTFRieXh6dXFGN